=== Test 4: CTE-body FORCE INDEX ===
== Query ==
WITH s AS (SELECT a AS k, SUM(v) AS tot
FROM hint_t FORCE INDEX (idx_a) WHERE a = 10 GROUP BY a)
SELECT k, tot FROM s;

Number of output lines, including header: 2

== Diff ==
==========



== Expected result ==
WITH s AS (SELECT a AS k, SUM(v) AS tot
FROM hint_t FORCE INDEX (idx_a) WHERE a = 10 GROUP BY a)
SELECT k, tot FROM s|
k	tot
10	45


